**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore

# Secrets & Config local
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/secrets.json

# Logs
*.log
logs/
**/logs/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

